d directly in  front of it Bumi BOSU fires an energy  beam that can kill you instantly  stay close to this yokai to take her  klaustreichs  out of the equation stamina management  is key since you need to run for cover  to avoid the wide area of effect of her  overhead attacks if you've stopped up on  stamina enhancing items the ogre assist  second phase is the time to use them the  flowers that bloom during the stage of  the battle will create key dead zones  your stamina recovery will be severely  limited so pick your spots carefully  when resuming your attacks  [Music]  for some of you this frosty gal will be  neo's hardest boss her most lethal  attack is a stab which is hard to defend  given the subtlety of its warning side  you'll know she's about to attempt a  stab when her staff disappears this is  not to be confused with her staff throat  which like her other range attacks is  easy to avoid with side steps it's good  practice to keep your distance for most  of the fight and rely on your long  distance attacks for more neo guides and  my review check out GameSpot and make  sure to subscribe to our YouTube channel  [Music]  you  [Music]
 

